itle": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le13ob11re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le13ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le13ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le13ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Hey Vanessa, listen up! I got Peter season's tickets to see the Celtics!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> How did that come about?! You must be in love!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Wouldn't it be great if we could find someone for you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Forget about me! Don't you think we should ask Peter about his date?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> No way! He'll get so worked up if we do.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Hey ladies! Isn't it a wonderfully beautiful day?"}, {"time": "27000", "image": "engenn8le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Didn't you guys watch last night's game?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> I did. It was a great game. Correct me if I'm wrong, didn't you go on a date?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Maybe we should drop the subject before anyone gets immensely uncomfortable. We have to respect Peter's boundaries.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> You're supposed to be the one asking these questions Sally! Lighten up a little.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Okay everyone, calm down. We might want to relax and enjoy our evening together.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Peter, I have something for you. Here."}, {"time": "59000", "image": "engenn8le13ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Sally. You shouldn't have!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Are you hugging me? Wow! Okay, I'm totally taken aback!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Public displays of affection! Surprise gifts!  It's not even Christmas. What happened to you two? Well, I have a little something for the two of you.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Celtics jerseys! Thank you!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> You are the best! Let's root for V! This has turned into a great evening!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Now tell me what your plans are for Valentine's day?"}]}}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}